========= LLAMA LLM =============

1. https://dev.to/ajitkumar/the-complete-guide-to-ollama-run-large-language-models-locally-2mge

Download Ollama:
		|_ curl -fsSL https://ollama.com/install.sh | sh
		|_ ollama run <model>:Xb
				<model> is model name with version number - example: llama3.2:3b or llama3.1:4b or llama 3.1:8b
						Important: Don't think llama 3.2 is better than 3.1 - Actually 3.1 is more better so read these before deciding whcih model to use
						Other point: The higher number of Xb the better and deep resoning answers are given by model
				(b stands for billion - X billion number of parameter weights that were used to train model by model provider)
		|_ ollama list
		|_ ollama help
				Note: Temperature value controls the creativeness of the model - Lower is not bad, lower is better if you want more deterministics answers as it becomes less creative and more straight thinking.

